{"name":"Burlywood","hex":"#deb887","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"burlywood","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A brown sandy colour, of RGB hexadecimal value #DEB887."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a brown sandy colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/burlywood"}],"entries":[{"title":"X11 color names","blocks":[{"text":"In computing, on the X Window System, X11 color names are represented in a simple text file, which maps certain strings to RGB color values. It was traditionally shipped with every X11 installation, hence the name, and is usually located in <X11root>/lib/X11/rgb.txt. The web colors list is descended from it but differs for certain color names."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X11_color_names","wikidata":"Q376249"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Shades_of_red.png/500px-Shades_of_red.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Shades_of_red.png/500px-Shades_of_red.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShades_of_red.png"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"1995 UAZ 2206 beige rear","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg/500px-1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg","ratio":1.2959381044487428,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg","share":0.1675},{"title":"Hyundai Kona Hybrid Inspiration SX2 HEV Beige Color Package (8)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Package_%288%29.jpg/500px-Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Package_%288%29.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Packag